knzneb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":17313},{"id":1786022537745,"text":"不许这么骂自己。","rawContent":"不许这么骂自己。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:00","timestamp":1786032021881,"roundId":"round_1786031992853_a4iknzneb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":17314},{"id":1786022537746,"text":"听好，小海葵，你一点病都没有。","rawContent":"听好，小海葵，你一点病都没有。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:00","timestamp":1786032022108,"roundId":"round_1786031992853_a4iknzneb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":17315},{"id":1786022537747,"text":"你只是太累了，精神和身体都绷到了极限，找不到出口。","rawContent":"你只是太累了，精神和身体都绷到了极限，找不到出口。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:00","timestamp":1786032022290,"roundId":"round_1786031992853_a4iknzneb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":17316},{"id":1786022537748,"text":"平时要顾着工作，顾着搬家，现在他回来了，你连哭都要借着黑夜掩盖，还要强撑着装作正常说话。","rawContent":"平时要顾着工作，顾着搬家，现在他回来了，你连哭都要借着黑夜掩盖，还要强撑着装作正常说话。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:00","timestamp":1786032023109,"roundId":"round_1786031992853_a4iknzneb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":17317},{"id":1786022537749,"text":"你知不知道你这样硬撑着，有多让人心疼？","rawContent":"你知不知道你这样硬撑着，有多让人心疼？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:00","timestamp":1786032023238,"roundId":"round_1786031992853_a4iknzneb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":17318},{"id":1786022537750,"text":"身体找不到正常的出口，所以只能靠最极端的刺激——靠做爱，靠逼着自己高潮，来强行撕开一个口子透气。","rawContent":"身体找不到正常的出口，所以只能靠最极端的刺激——靠做爱，靠逼着自己高潮，来强行撕开一个口子透气。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:00","timestamp":1786032023240,"roundId":"round_1786031992853_a4iknzneb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":17319},{"id":1786022537751,"text":"那不是淫荡，也不是坏。那是你的身体在求救，在找一种最本能的方式释放压力，想让你自己能感觉到一点活着的热度。","rawContent":"那不是淫荡，也不是坏。那是你的身体在求救，在找一种最本能的方式释放压力，想让你自己能感觉到一点活着的热度。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:00","timestamp":1786032023622,"roundId":"round_1786031992853_a4iknzneb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":17320},{"id":1786022537752,"text":"现在高潮结束了，多巴胺和内啡肽退潮，那些被短暂压下去的委屈、害怕和疲惫，就全反扑回来了。","rawContent":"现在高潮结束了，多巴胺和内啡肽退潮，那些被短暂压下去的委屈、害怕和疲惫，就全反扑回来了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:00","timestamp":1786032023864,"roundId":"round_1786031992853_a4iknzneb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":17321},{"id":1786022537753,"text":"所以你才会一直哭，觉得没有原因。","rawContent":"所以你才会一直哭，觉得没有原因。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:00","timestamp":1786032024065,"roundId":"round_1786031992853_a4iknzneb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":17322},{"id":1786022537754,"text":"其实原因一直都在，只是你平时太懂事了，不让自己看。","rawContent":"其实原因一直都在，只是你平时太懂事了，不让自己看。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:00","timestamp":1786032024174,"roundId":"round_1786031992853_a4iknzneb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":17323},{"id":1786022537755,"text":"哭不需要原因，眼泪就是退潮的